  partName: Oil Pan Gasket (5)
  description: The Oil Pan Gasket (5) is a tiny, thin-flat component located at the
    bottom-center-center of the engine, made of Material.003, responsible for sealing
    the oil pan and preventing oil leaks. Its central location and specific material
    ensure a reliable seal, and a notable aspect is its durability and resistance
    to wear.
